✨ 01. PROJECT OVERVIEW

The Personal Portfolio Website is a frontend development project developed as part of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development & Designing Internship — Level 1, Task 2.

The project presents a professional digital identity through a visually engaging and responsive portfolio.

It introduces Muhammad Yaseen, professionally known as Yaseen Baloch, a Computer Science undergraduate and aspiring Software Engineer with interests in programming, web development, AI automation, and technology entrepreneurship.

The visual direction combines a premium dark interface, purple accents, modern typography, elegant content cards, and responsive layouts.

Design Philosophy: Learn continuously. Build meaningfully. Innovate confidently.

